From 589f66906be8bf7d9eea6c9b3008e0d41794563b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fruitzail <mfm9875@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 12:35:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] power: Add supported WALT CPU sessions and FMQ dispatch

Select an independent CPU ADPF backend for Asteroids without the failing
Picard registration gate. Use the existing task-load resource, validate
inputs and session ownership, and release boosts across lifecycle changes.
Advertise only implemented session capabilities and preserve existing boosts.

Mechanism reference: https://github.com/AOSPA/android_vendor_qcom-opensource_power/commit/b9054aaa32b5b76653a6753adc1f95862f709b9a

Validation: service/test sources compiled in an earlier focused attempt and
policy checks passed; the test executable was not linked/run, and device
validation remains pending under the build hold.

Signed-off-by: fruitzail <mfm9875@gmail.com>
